      "writtenOn": "2026-02-12T18:19:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need a layer ordering check here, to only update `deferredLayer` if `fDeferredLayer` is more recent.  `fDeferredLayer` will be more recent than the passed in `deferredLayer` when it was the first use of the clip element, but depending on how different draws overlap with difference clip ops, we could activate a new element in the stack first, then activate an older element on a later draw, creating an inversion of the layer ordering vs. the element ordering.",
